# Contributing

## Workflow

1. Open an issue file issues/I-NN-slug.md (copy issues/TEMPLATE.md). Labels come
   from docs/agents/triage-labels.md.
2. Branch from main: mr/I-NN-slug.
3. Commit with the issue id in the subject: <type>(<scope>): I-NN <summary>.
4. Push the branch: git push -u origin mr/I-NN-slug.
5. Record the MR in merge-requests/I-NN.md and request review.
6. After approval, merge with --no-ff and update the record (head, merged_as).

## Rules

- main is protected: only merge commits and tracker-only commits (issues/,
  merge-requests/) are accepted by the server.
- Never force-push main; never rewrite reviewed MR history.
- Tests: make test (or the focused pytest nodes) must pass before review.
- Do not commit secrets, large files, .soft-serve/, sessions/, or .scratch/.

## Local setup

    python3 -m venv .venv
    .venv/bin/pip install -e ".[dev]"
    make test
